<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aspen Technology cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aspen Technology cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen and Co said on Thursday it lowered its rating on the shares of Aspen Technology Inc to a buy from a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 2-5/8 to 35-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
